WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:01,040
twenty times

2
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:02,340
It originally sold well

3
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:04,180
Later, I don’t know where someone came from.

4
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,340
They said at the door that the coffee in our store tastes like horse urine.

5
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:09,020
He also said that the plain packaged coffee in the convenience store across the street is the state religion.

6
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:11,500
Everyone was dissatisfied and ran over to try it.

7
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:13,900
Then he didn't come back

8
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:16,170
It must have been the scale fish.

9
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:20,100
I thought this would allow me to retire and wanted to lower the price.

10
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:22,130
starting from today

11
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:23,290
50% off all coffee

12
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:24,650
Buy more than two cups at a time

13
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:26,930
Give another five yuan to the boss without entrance coupons

14
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:28,850
We will lose money by selling like this.

15
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:30,010
What does it mean to lose for a few days?

16
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:31,290
Grab the person first

17
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:32,570
Wait until other stores can’t hold on

18
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:34,490
The business on this street is naturally ours

19
00:00:34,810 --> 00:00:37,490
Congratulations to the host

20
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:39,610
Revenue exceeded 2,000 yuan for the first time that day

21
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:42,090
Get a chance to perform the next stage day
